https://github.com/jatmn/Yuoki-Factorio-2.0/blob/ce7918f2b252f2d79ba86b9ae05d991e7af1f261/Licence.txt

Quinityn adapts YuokiTani's contract-world lore into a playable planet and
adds a landscape, visit-gated research, salvage, science, local production
and foundations. Unicomp oceans and this landscape are new interpretations.
The add-on references installed Yuoki assets and prototypes; it does not
replace the parent mod or claim authorship of its art, lore or machines.
Historical sources and adaptation boundaries are in the source repository:
https://github.com/jatmn/yuoki-quinityn/blob/main/docs/research.md

